# Global
BufferLimit 100m


# Personal
## matthiasmeijers@proton.me
IMAPAccount matthiasmeijers-proton
Host 127.0.0.1 
Port 1143
User matthiasmeijers@proton.me
PassCmd "secret-tool lookup service proton-bridge account personal"
TLSType STARTTLS
SystemCertificates no
CertificateFile ${XDG_CONFIG_HOME}/proton/bridge/cert.pem

IMAPStore matthiasmeijers-proton-remote
Account matthiasmeijers-proton

MaildirStore matthiasmeijers-proton-local
Path ${MAILDIR}/matthiasmeijers-proton/
Inbox ${MAILDIR}/matthiasmeijers-proton/INBOX/
MaxSize 50m
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel matthiasmeijers-proton
Far :matthiasmeijers-proton-remote:
Near :matthiasmeijers-proton-local:
Sync New Gone Flags
Patterns * "!All Mail"
Create Both
# Expunge Both
CopyArrivalDate yes
SyncState *

## Group
Group personal
Channel matthiasmeijers-proton
